  "ruleText": "He-A 907.04 Accessibility. Each phase II program provider shall provide handicapped accessibility into and within the provider’s buildings, in compliance with the Americans with Disabilities Act.\n\nSource. #7058, eff 7-21-99; ss by #8902, INTERIM, eff 7-13-07, EXPIRED: 1-9-08\n\nNew. #9082, eff 1-30-08",
